        <mxCell id="UFMUTEeKRGwuUtpjpM2a-63" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;铲装包括单斗挖掘机、轮斗铲、前端式装载机、电耙等。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;车铲比是衡量匹配程度的重要参数。车铲比过大，铲装设备利用率低；车铲比过小，运输设备等待时间长。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;技术参数：台阶高度，工作平台宽度，采掘带宽度，开采顺序，边坡角等。&lt;span style=&quot;caret-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); font-family: monospace; font-size: 0px; white-space: nowrap;&quot;&gt;%3CmxGraphModel%3E%3Croot%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%221%22%20parent%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3CmxCell%20id%3D%222%22%20parent%3D%221%22%20style%3D%22rounded%3D0%3BwhiteSpace%3Dwrap%3Bhtml%3D1%3Balign%3Dleft%3B%22%20value%3D%22%26lt%3Bdiv%20style%3D%26quot%3Btext-align%3A%20center%3B%26quot%3B%26gt%3B%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B%E6%B5%85%E5%AD%94%E7%88%86%E7%A0%B4%EF%BC%9A%E4%BF%AE%E8%B7%AF%EF%BC%8C%E5%A4%A7%E5%9D%97%E4%BA%8C%E6%AC%A1%E7%88%86%E7%A0%B4%EF%BC%8C%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E6%A0%B9%E5%BA%95%E7%AD%89%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%26lt%3Bdiv%26gt%3B%E6%B7%B1%E5%AD%94%E7%88%86%E7%A0%B4%EF%BC%9A%E9%9C%B2%E5%A4%A9%E5%8F%B0%E9%98%B6%E6%AD%A3%E5%B8%B8%E9%87%87%E6%8E%98%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%26lt%3B%2Fdiv%26gt%3B%22%20vertex%3D%221%22%3E%3CmxGeometry%20height%3D%2240%22%20width%3D%22250%22%20x%3D%2265%22%20y%3D%22335%22%20as%3D%22geometry%22%2F%3E%3C%2FmxCell%3E%3C%2Froot%3E%3C%2FmxGraphModel%3E包括单斗挖掘机、轮斗铲、前端式装载机、电耙等包括单斗挖掘机、轮斗铲、前端式装载机、电耙等包括单斗挖掘机、轮斗铲、前端式装载机、电耙等包括单斗挖掘机、轮斗铲、前端式来看&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
